# 19. SECURITY

Follow good security practices.

Important:

* Validate uploaded files
* Restrict file size
* Only allow supported MIME types
* Sanitize filenames
* Never trust client-side hashes
* Calculate hashes server-side
* Never expose private keys
* Never store wallet private keys
* Protect API endpoints
* Implement authorization
* Prevent users from accessing another organization's documents
* Validate blockchain transaction results
* Prevent duplicate registrations
* Do not expose sensitive document metadata publicly

